<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle market not tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle market not tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not tested, compared with Tuesday's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Carcass basis Steers and heifers were not well tested. Steers - Select and Choice 2-3 1175 lbs few 1113.25. Reported sales for Wed - 200. Week to Date - 5,700</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720--</p>
